cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use cffLaTeX, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: "cffLaTeX: Import CFF metadata into LaTeX"
abstract: >-
  Modern research software and datasets often include a CFF (Citation
  File Format) file to provide metadata for proper citation. When you
  write the manuscript that is to be cited, you need to ensure that the
  manuscript and the CFF file have consistent metadata. cffLaTeX helps
  with this process by reading the metadata from the CFF file and
  incorporating it into the LaTeX document.
authors:
